{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 1 från S.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 1 by S.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "International cooperation", "dok_titel": "International relations etc.", "forslag_text": "The Riksdag rejects the motions\n\n2024/25:1323 by Jacob Risberg et al. (MP) demand 2,\n\n2024/25:1439 by Markus Wiechel et al. (SD) demands 1 and 2,\n\n2024/25:3038 by Daniel Helldén et al. (MP) demand 3,\n\n2024/25:3107 by Morgan Johansson et al. (S) demands 1, 24, 26 and 32, and\n\n2024/25:3162 by Kerstin Lundgren et al. (C) demands 1, 3 and 52.", "notis": "The Riksdag rejected approximately 130 proposals in motions about international relations.\nThe motions were submitted during the general motion period 2024 and concern, among other things, international cooperation, gender equality and women, peace and security, relations with China and consular matters.", "alternatives": ["The Riksdag rejects the motions\n\n2024/25:1323 by Jacob Risberg et al. (MP) demand 2,\n\n2024/25:1439 by Markus Wiechel et al. (SD) demands 1 and 2,\n\n2024/25:3038 by Daniel Helldén et al. (MP) demand 3,\n\n2024/25:3107 by Morgan Johansson et al. (S) demands 1, 24, 26 and 32, and\n\n2024/25:3162 by Kerstin Lundgren et al. (C) demands 1, 3 and 52.", "Reservation 1"]}, "votering_id": "E7E60FCE-12D0-4110-B9EF-7D0482B5E559", "rm": "2024/25", "beteckning": "UU7", "punkt": 1, "dok_id": "HC01UU7", "datum": "2025-05-14", "utskott": "UU", "rubrik": "Internationell samverkan", "dok_titel": "Internationella relationer m.m.", "sammanfattning": "Utrikesutskottet föreslår att riksdagen säger